{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Watch a need"},"description":"Watches a need; CATEGORY follows a process. Optional target selects one product and capability_ids (empty = whole product), counted once. Targeted alerts report documented changes, conditions and unknowns, not a guarantee of suitability. Initially not_computed; rules produce challenger/switch brief; alerts on following calls. Unknown constraints stay uninterpreted. prepaid-v1: payment_required (402), draft_id, watch_status DRAFT, destination /my/plan. Legacy: free_watch_used (409, Checkout). plan_ending (409) refuses new watches. Errors: _meta[\"ai.hodds/error\"]. Search is free. Price: \u20ac2 excl. VAT at the start of each monthly period covers the first 4 counted watches; initial basket extras: \u20ac0.50 each now; later extras: \u20ac0.50 excl. VAT at period end, never charged twice. A person accepts the summary at destination. Legacy rights stay unchanged. Needs an organisation token (Authorization: Bearer hodds_...); without it the tool returns the error token_required.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"alert_budget":{"default":5,"description":"Alerts per calendar month (1-20, default 5); beyond, one DIGEST per day.","maximum":20,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"context":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"constraints":{"description":"Constraints of the need.","items":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"environment":{"description":"Free description of the environment (not stored).","maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"current_choice":{"description":"Active catalogue id; any process accepted.","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]{0,62}[a-z0-9])?$","type":"string"},"current_choice_name":{"description":"Free name instead of id; exact unique matches resolve, others stay unlinked.","maxLength":120,"type":["string","null"]},